cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, its registry or its paper, please cite it as below."
title: "N-Ways Addressing for Benin"
abstract: >-
  An addressing model, reference engine, registry and server that give every compound
  in Benin a code made of the name of its quartier or village and a number of four or
  five digits, unique in the whole country on its own (4,147,741 codes issued on
  20 October 2026).
authors:
  - name: "The N-Ways Addressing Group"
    address: "N-WAYS LIMITED"
    website: "https://nways.ng"
    email: "hello@nways.ng"
date-released: 2026-10-20
url: "https://github.com/n-ways/open-addresses-benin"
